<Report xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <GUID>eb7098e0-baf3-ccff-141c-c67815599a78</GUID>
  <Guide>&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Map view displays one point per row of the model: the 'Latitude' and 'Longitude' columns are found by their name.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Northwind database has no coordinates: the report defines its own table 'Cities' (SQL of the table in the report source) joined to the Customers table.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The points are colored by 'Customer Country' and sized by 'Amount' (parameters 'Color column' and 'Size column' of the Map view).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Click a point to show its popup, click a legend item to show or hide a country.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An Internet connection is required to display the background tiles (OpenStreetMap by default, see the 'Tiles URL' parameter).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</Guide>
